    "# Baseline Evaluation - Building on Gemini Session Work\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook expands upon the existing Gemini session work to create a proper baseline evaluation.\n",
    "We will:\n",
    "1. Examine and understand the existing LoRA setup\n",
    "2. Add proper data loading and preprocessing\n",
    "3. Implement a training loop with validation\n",
    "4. Add evaluation metrics suitable for the reasoning challenge\n",
    "5. Create a solid foundation for further enhancements\n",
    "\n",
    "## Building Upon Existing Work\n",
    "\n",
    "The existing Gemini session work (in `00_gemini_baseline_lora.ipynb`) established:\n",
    "- Dependency installation: `mamba_ssm`, `causal-conv1d`, `peft`\n",
    "- Model loading: `nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B` in BF16\n",
    "- LoRA configuration: r=8, lora_alpha=16, target_modules=[\"x_proj\", \"embeddings\"]\n",
    "- Adapter saving capability\n",
    "\n",
    "We will extend this to create a complete training and evaluation pipeline."
   ]
